# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): abox-declared-clash's control. ⊤ ⊑ A only.
# Expect: consistent; owl:Thing ⊑ A.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:A a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf :A .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual .
